  1555	      // the same polygon corner, so the nearest vertex IS that corner and the
  1556	      // junction still demanded the full corner turn (measured 112° — the stall).
  1557	      // Require the candidate's OUTGOING heading to align with the previous
  1558	      // ring's exit heading (within 45°): concentric rings have a parallel edge
  1559	      // there, so the join becomes a tangent ~op_width sideways shift. Fall back
  1560	      // to plain nearest if nothing aligns (degenerate tiny ring).
