  1704	  // radius (mowgli_robot.yaml min_turning_radius). Shrinking a turn-around below
  1705	  // this to "fit in-bounds" produced loops FTC could not track (wz≈vx/r), so the
  1706	  // robot looped/hesitated; when no arc >= this fits, buildConnector falls back
  1707	  // to a straight join instead of an untrackable loop.
