  1828	        sp, boundary, plan.safe_holes, kCornerThreshold, fillet_r, min_radius, step);
  1829	    // SAFETY (#388): the ring/swath poses are appended verbatim from F2C, and the
  1830	    // OUTERMOST ring's convex-corner vertices can poke a few cm PAST the clearance
  1831	    // ring — generateHeadlandSwaths (the ring) and generateHeadlands (this
